# Summary

The handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook [[cite:obs-0ffc0a4f39854f7cda7de0629f2f7eba761c5c39 "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].

The appendix specifies that bays twelve through thirty are blocked, reserved for supplier vans only, with a midday deadline [[cite:obs-a088657ee84a0b9fb22f3304bf292a1c3ef0564a "Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only, midday deadline."]].
